  "name": "Bering and Chukchi Sea Bathymetry",
  "description": "Bathymetric contours of the Bering and Chukchi Seas at 1:2,500,00 scale. Digitized from two USGS maps: \"Bathymetric Map of the Chukchi Sea\" (OFR 76-823, 1976) and \"Bathymetric Map of the Aleutian Trench and Bering Sea\" (OFR-76-821, 1976).\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This coverage was created to support marine mammal and bird research at the Alaska Biological Science Center.",
